# Build context of deploy/docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile). Allowlist: only what
# the Go build needs enters the context, so keys, network folders and
# competitor clones can never end up in an image layer.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!VERSION
!cmd
!internal
!tools
!vendor
!deploy/docker/entrypoint.sh

# Never, even inside the allowed folders.
**/*.key
**/*.passphrase
**/parola*.txt
**/network.json
**/history
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
**/*.test
**/.*.tmp-*
